# Windows：减少 pnpm 默认的 symlink 布局，避免向 OpenClaw extensions 安装插件时 EPERM（symlink 无权限）
# 若仍失败，请在「设置 → 隐私和安全性 → 开发者选项」中开启「开发人员模式」
node-linker=hoisted
registry=https://registry.npmmirror.com
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org
registry=https://registry.npmmirror.com
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org
registry=https://registry.npmmirror.com
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org
registry=https://registry.npmmirror.com
